5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to verify the actual costs before committing. Last year’s deficit is still unresolved.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. But cost is only half the problem. Last year’s organizers burned out completely. We need a plan that doesn’t destroy the people running it.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,The destination dictates who interacts with whom. Last year’s isolation between year-groups was a failure. We need a setting that forces evening contact.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I need to understand the sleep and daily rhythm. Last camp’s poor rest ruined our final sessions.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"A flat fee hides individual spending. If someone cancels late, who covers the gap? We need clear liability terms before booking anything.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, your point on organizer burnout is valid. We must ensure the logistics do not consume the camp itself.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, exactly. If the logistics eat the training, we fail. I need to see how much time the setup actually demands.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Toshio, I agree. But logistics are secondary to the social structure. If we don't fix the year-group isolation, the camp fails its primary purpose.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, I hear you, but a forced social structure is useless if everyone is exhausted. I need to know the actual sleep conditions first.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, exhaustion is a symptom, not the cause. I need to know the financial liability if someone drops out. Who pays the deposit?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, liability is critical. I will investigate the transport receipts to see where the money actually went.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, I will check the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty. I need to know if we can avoid that time drain.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Ryuji, I will check the seniors' views on year-group mixing and the attendance sheets. I need to know if shared sleeping actually drives interaction and who stays.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, I will look into the prefecture rate sheet and the accounts from clubs that went inland. I need to know the true cost and the actual sleeping conditions.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
