51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, precisely. The administrative burden is the real killer. I will not spend a month on paperwork. We need a venue where the logistics are handled, not by us.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
